 "description": "The three EIP-1967 slots (implementation, admin, beacon) read next to implementation(): a proxy hides the real code, so bytecode-size checks alone understate what an upgrade can change. Costs $0.001 USDC per call. Chains: base, ethereum, arbitrum, bsc, polygon, optimism, avalanche. Byte-identical to GET /chain/proxy-check?chain=base&address=0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913.",
